---
description: Karzar issue execution contract — scope, truth, stop conditions
alwaysApply: true
---

Follow root `AGENTS.md`.

For implementation tasks:
- Fetch current `origin/main` and current GitHub Issue/PR state before changing code.
- Treat prompt SHAs and copied status as stale until re-attested.
- Keep one Issue per branch/PR. No unrelated refactor or cleanup.
- Preserve unrelated dirty files; prefer isolated worktree/branch.
- If main moves materially, report `TARGET_MOVED`; do not paper over integration risk.
- Stop at owner/business-policy boundaries rather than inventing decisions.
- Do not merge, deploy, mutate production/catalog, or initiate real payment unless explicitly authorized.
- Exit with the compact standard evidence contract from root `AGENTS.md`.
